#                      properties
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleComputer.cpp (lines 2241-2793): the computed values of custom
#       properties (var() substitution through r33's arbitrary substitution functions),
#       compute_custom_properties, the line-width keywords and border-width snapping, the
#       coordinated list helpers, compute_value_of_property and the per-property computations
#       of animation-name, font-feature/variation settings, border and outline widths, corner
#       shapes, font-size (with the math scaling), font-style, font-weight, font-width and
